      <ol>
        <li><strong>Capture — jobs, steps, and desired outcomes with importance/satisfaction scores, via CLI, connectors, or The Living Studio.</strong></li>
        <li><strong>Query — agents call MCP tools for job maps and opportunity scores at decision time, local or hosted.</strong></li>
