**Breakpoints (3 total, all `max-width`):**

| Query | What changes |
|---|---|
| `@media (max-width: 1023px)` | **The seam.** `.lens` becomes a fixed full-screen overlay (`z-index: 60`) with a scrim; gutters tighten 22px→18px; `.setup__replies` loses its indent; `.composer__hint span:first-child` hides; `.before-after` collapses to 1 column. |
| `@media (max-width: 640px)` | `.ui-grid--2/3` → single column; wizard panel becomes full-screen `100dvh`, `border-radius: 0`. |
| `@media (max-width: 600px)` | `.changelog-release` grid 100px/1fr → 1fr. |
| `@media (hover: none)` | `.message__actions` always visible (touch). |
| `@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark)` | **Not used** — the app is dark-only via `color-scheme: dark`. |
| `@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)` | Declared **four separate times** (theme.css lines 1681, 2399, 2800; onboarding.css line ~533). Each nukes animation/transition duration to `0.001ms` / `0.01ms`. |

**Global resets:** `* { box-sizing: border-box }`; `html, body, #root { height: 100% }`; `body { margin: 0; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased }`; `button { -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent }`; `:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--accent); outline-offset: 2px }`; `.sr-only` utility; custom `::-webkit-scrollbar` (8px, `rgba(255,255,255,0.15)` thumb, `rgba(0,0,0,0.2)` track, 4px radius).

### 1e. The file's layered history (important for the marketing site)

`theme.css` is a palimpsest of four generations appended chronologically:

1. **Lines 1–1440** — the original hand-crafted system (`--bg`, `--accent`, `--faint`, `.chat`, `.composer`, `.card`, `.badge`, `.metric`).
2. **Lines 1442–1613** — "Manual data controls" + bell/catch-up.
3. **Lines 1614–2407** — the "Generated surfaces" block (`.ui-*`), which is the **Tailwind-slate-flavoured** generation.
4. **Lines 2409–2608** — Changelog modal ("Steve Jobs Quality").
5. **Lines 2610–2809** — "PR #61 micro-interactions" — the Apple-glass generation, adding the `--ease-*` tokens.
6. **Lines 2810–3094** — "One room: the conversation never leaves the stage" — the **Rail + Lens** generation.

### 1f. FULL VERBATIM `theme.css`

I read all 3094 lines above; the complete file is reproduced in the sections that follow, unabridged, in original order.

```css
:root {
  color-scheme: dark;
  --bg: #0a0b0e;
  --bg-raised: #0e1014;
  --text: #f1f2f4;
  --muted: #a2a7b3;
  --faint: #71767f;
  --accent: #8b8cf8;
  --accent-strong: #6366f1;
  --green: #4ade80;
  --amber: #f0b34a;
  --line: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07);
  --line-strong: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);
  --surface: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
  --surface-hover: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
  --font: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
  --mono: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, "SF Mono", Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
}

* {
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

html,
body,
#root {
  height: 100%;
}

body {
  margin: 0;
  background: var(--bg);
  color: var(--text);
  font-family: var(--font);
  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
}

button,
input,
select,
