## 4. Motion & animation

**No framer-motion, no GSAP, no react-transition-group, no animation library of any kind.** All motion is CSS transitions and `@keyframes`.

### Named keyframes (all 16, complete)

| Keyframe | Duration | Easing | What it does |
|---|---|---|---|
| `shimmer` | `1.6s` infinite | `ease-in-out` | Skeleton sweep (bg-position -200% → 200%) |
| `hero-in` | `0.5s` | `cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1)` | Hero headline: opacity + `translateY(6px)` + `blur(2px)` → 0 |
| `pulse-badge` | `2s` infinite | `ease-in-out` | Bell badge: `scale(1)→1.1` + glow ring |
| `surface-enter` | `0.28s` | `cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1)` | Agent surface enters: opacity + `translateY(6px)` |
| `pill-dot-pulse` | `2s` infinite | `ease-in-out` | Status dot: opacity 1→0.4, `scale(1)→0.75` |
| `evidencePulse` | — | — | Opacity 1 → 0.6 (declared, never bound) |
| `pulse-amber-glow` | — | — | Amber fire glow on underserved cards: box-shadow 12px→24px, border `#f59e0b`→`#fbbf24` |
| `chatBubblePopIn` | — | — | `translateY(10px) scale(0.95)` → 0/1 (declared, never bound) |
| `thinkingPulse` | — | — | Opacity 0.4→1, `scale(0.98)→1.02` (declared, never bound) |
| `toastSlideIn` | `0.35s` | `var(--ease-apple-spring)` | Elastic slide: `translateX(40px) scale(0.9)` → overshoot `-4px/1.02` → 0/1 |
| `lens-in` | `0.22s` | `cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1)` | Lens docks: `translateX(12px)` + fade |
| `wizard-fade` | `200ms` | `ease-out` | Onboarding backdrop fade |
| `wizard-enter` | `320ms` | `cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1)` | Panel: `translateY(14px) scale(0.985)` → 0/1 |
| `wizard-rise` | `280ms` | `cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1)` | Body content: `translateY(8px)` → 0 |
| `wizard-pulse` | `1.2s` infinite | `ease-in-out` | Pending check dot: opacity 0.35 → 1 |
| `dot-pulse` | `1.2s` infinite | `ease-in-out` | Typing dots (staggered 0s/0.15s/0.3s) — **used but never defined** |
| `caret-blink` | `1s` infinite | `steps(1)` | Streaming caret — **used but never defined** |
| `fade-in` | — | — | Used at 0.12s/0.24s/0.25s/0.3s in 8 places — **used but NEVER defined anywhere** |

### Easing tokens

```css
--ease-apple-out:    cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);     /* the house curve */
--ease-apple-spring: cubic-bezier(0.175, 0.885, 0.32, 1.22);
--ease-tactile:      cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1);
```

### Transition duration ladder (the vocabulary)

`0.1s` (press) → `0.12s` (palette) → `0.14s` (hover tint) → `0.15s` (standard hover) → `0.16s` (composer focus) → `0.2s` (card lift) → `0.22s` (lens) → `0.25s` (message) → `0.28s` (surface) → `0.35s` (toast) → `0.4s` (meter fill) → `0.5s` (hero) → `0.6s` (shimmer sweep).

### Micro-interactions (the "quiet gestures")

- Hover lift `translateY(-1px)` on `.suggestion`, `.catchup-card`, `.composer__send`
- Hover lift `translateY(-2px)` on `.outcome-card`
- Button press `scale(0.98)` on `.studio-button`; `translateY(1px)` on `.ui-action`
- Composer focus: border `rgba(139,140,248,0.42)` + 4px halo `rgba(99,102,241,0.09)`
- Hover-reveal actions: `.message__actions` and `.step__actions` at `opacity: 0` → 1 on `:hover`/`:focus-within`
- Typewriter caret: 7px × 1em accent bar, `steps(1)` blink
- Shimmer sweep on `.skeleton` (200% background-size, 90deg white-alpha gradient)
- Quick-pill shine: a 200%-wide `rotate(30deg)` gradient `::after` that sweeps on hover
- Apple range slider: 18px round thumb, `scale(1.25)` on hover, `scale(1.1)` + 4px ring on active
- `<details>` accordion: `transition: all 0.25s var(--ease-apple-out)`

**Reduced motion** is handled in 4 separate `@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)` blocks. Two of them use `0.001ms` and two use `0.01ms` — inconsistent but functionally equivalent.

