## 5. Iconography

**Custom, hand-authored inline SVG. No icon library.**

**Path:** `apps/studio/src/components/icons.tsx`

```tsx
/**
 * Inline icon set (stroke, 1.6px) so the studio stays dependency-free.
 */
```

Every icon is a `<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" strokeWidth={1.6} strokeLinecap="round" strokeLinejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">` with a `size` prop (default **18**).

**The 17 icons:** `PanelLeftIcon`, `PlusIcon`, `CompassIcon`, `RouteIcon`, `BoltIcon`, `SignalIcon`, `CaptureIcon`, `SettingsIcon`, `CloseIcon`, `ArrowUpIcon`, `StopIcon`, `CopyIcon`, `CheckIcon`, `SparkIcon`, `ArrowLeftIcon`, `MenuIcon`, `BellIcon`.

Icon sizes in use: `14`, `15`, `16`, `17`, `18` (default), `20`(?). Icon buttons are 32×32px with 9px radius. The **brand mark** is a 28×28px 9px-radius tile with `linear-gradient(140deg, rgba(99,102,241,0.55), rgba(139,92,246,0.25))`, `1px solid rgba(139,140,248,0.35)`, color `#d6d7ff`, containing `SparkIcon size={15}`.

